OL,3,GNEWSAHouse ramming charges in          
OL,4,Aconnection with A66 crash              
OL,6,FPolice have charged a number of men    
OL,7,Fwith ramming houses and vehicles prior 
OL,8,Fto a crash which killed two police     
OL,9,Fofficers and five young men.           
OL,11,FTwo men and a teenage boy appeared at  
OL,12,FTeesside Magistrates' Court on Thursday
OL,13,Fover events before the fatal head-on   
OL,14,Fcrash on the A66 near Middlesbrough in 
OL,15,FAugust.                                
OL,17,FCleveland Police said the charges      
OL,18,Frelated to two vehicles, a Volvo and   
OL,19,FLand Rover, suspected of being used to 
OL,20,Fdestroy or to cause damage to houses   
OL,21,Fand vehicles in Middlesbrough on 22    
OL,22,FAugust.                                
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
